# NK conformance driver nkc-ob (objects).
#
# The first request returns what the reference routines return and what
# referencing through a handle gives (wrong type, no handle, more access
# than the handle has, a kernel handle for user mode); the second, the
# kernel's store of security descriptors. 32 bits each, ending with
# 0x4E4B4321. What each value means is written beside it in nk-fixtures
# nkc/nkc-ob.c.

load nkc-ob nkc-ob.sys
open d \Device\NkcOb
ioctl d 00222000 - 16384
ioctl d 00222004 - 16384
close d
unload nkc-ob
